    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 11]\ntheorem erdos_536 :\n    answer(sorry) ↔ ∀ᵉ (ε > (0: ℝ)), ∀ᶠ N in atTop,\n    ∀ (A : Finset ℕ), A ⊆ Icc 1 N → (ε * (N : ℝ)) ≤ (A.card : ℝ) →\n    ∃ᵉ  (a ∈ A) (b ∈ A) (c ∈ A),\n    # {a, b, c} = 3 ∧ a.lcm b = b.lcm c ∧ b.lcm c = a.lcm c",
